WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:01.163
- All right, y'all.

00:00:01.163 --> 00:00:02.910
We always like to wrap
up with something fun.

00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:06.840
And today, well, this may
be my all-time favorite one.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.807
This is "#What I'm Liking".

00:00:08.807 --> 00:00:11.700
(upbeat music playing)
(audience applauding)

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:13.290
I'm so excited about this.

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:14.580
You may remember,

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:17.830
there was this really big
football game a couple days ago

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:21.090
surrounded by a concert
that was incredible.

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:23.160
It was predicted to be close, y'all.

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:25.500
And it, well, it sure delivered on that.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.480
I happened to make a little wager

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:30.660
on the game last week against
ESPN's Stephen A. Smith.

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:32.580
Let's just take a quick look at that.

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:34.030
- Well, what bet you want?

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:35.130
- [Kelly] Okay.
Okay.

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:36.420
- I'll bet Kelly Clark.

00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:38.253
- Okay, wait wait.
- I'll bet Kelly Clark.

00:00:38.253 --> 00:00:39.837
- Wait. Wait.
- All right, I'll do that.

00:00:39.837 --> 00:00:41.250
I'll do that.

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:42.960
- If the Chiefs...

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:45.030
If the Chiefs win

00:00:45.030 --> 00:00:46.170
you have to come on here

00:00:46.170 --> 00:00:49.393
and say you love the Dallas Cowboys.

00:00:49.393 --> 00:00:51.240
(audience booing)
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:55.110
And if the Eagles win,

00:00:55.110 --> 00:00:57.600
I have to come on your
show and do something...

00:00:57.600 --> 00:00:58.770
- [Stephen] That's right.
- embarrassing.

00:00:58.770 --> 00:01:00.390
- Let, let, let's do it this way.

00:01:00.390 --> 00:01:01.420
- [Kelly] Okay.
- I'll take that back.

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:02.670
- Okay.
Okay.

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:03.960
What do I have to do?

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:06.753
- If the Eagles win this Super Bowl,

00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:09.960
you don't have to be a song.

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:10.793
- Okay.

00:01:10.793 --> 00:01:12.510
- I want you to sing a tune dedicated

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:14.679
to Stephen A. Smith, The Straight Shooter.

00:01:14.679 --> 00:01:16.238
(Kelly laughing and applauding)

00:01:16.238 --> 00:01:17.945
(audience applauding)

00:01:17.945 --> 00:01:19.590
- I'll take it.
I'll take it.

00:01:19.590 --> 00:01:20.423
Oh my God.

00:01:20.423 --> 00:01:22.667
Come on, Chiefs!
(scattered laughter)

00:01:22.667 --> 00:01:24.665
Do this for me!

00:01:24.665 --> 00:01:26.004
(audience applauding)

00:01:26.004 --> 00:01:28.604
- Yeah.

00:01:28.604 --> 00:01:31.635
- Well, we all know how that worked out.

00:01:31.635 --> 00:01:32.468
I won!

00:01:33.765 --> 00:01:35.995
(audience cheering)

00:01:35.995 --> 00:01:37.328
I am so excited.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:42.240
Now it's time for The
Straight Shooter to deliver.

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:44.370
We have Stephen A. Smith
on the line right now.

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:45.411
What's up, Stephen?

00:01:45.411 --> 00:01:46.244
(Kelly laughing and applauding)

00:01:46.244 --> 00:01:49.740
(audience cheering)

00:01:49.740 --> 00:01:52.150
- Hi, Kelly.
How are you?

00:01:52.150 --> 00:01:53.400
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:54.233
- Oh my God.

00:01:54.233 --> 00:01:57.090
That's what your face looked
like when we were in the suite.

00:01:57.090 --> 00:01:59.520
So by coincidence-
- It's unbelievable.

00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:02.010
- I can't even, can you
even believe when you walked

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:04.680
in this week, I was like,
"We're in the same suite?"

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:05.970
What, we were, they put
us in the same suite

00:02:05.970 --> 00:02:07.410
- [Stephen] I know.
at the Super Bowl.

00:02:07.410 --> 00:02:09.180
- [Kelly] And, I know, Oh my God.

00:02:09.180 --> 00:02:10.830
So freaking funny.

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:12.780
So you, were you freaking out

00:02:12.780 --> 00:02:14.310
as that game clock was winding down?

00:02:14.310 --> 00:02:15.780
- Yeah, and I was looking
at you like, "Ohh!"

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:19.980
- I was, I was.
I thought the Eagles had 'em.

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:23.580
I mean, they still went up
24 to 14 in the first half.

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:24.720
- [Kelly] I know.
I was like, "This is good.

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:27.799
I'm gonna have Kelly
Clarkson sing a song to me."

00:02:27.799 --> 00:02:29.220
I mean, this is beautiful.

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:31.350
And the next thing I know, you know,

00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:33.261
everything fell apart, you know.

00:02:33.261 --> 00:02:35.040
(Kelly laughing)
I didn't expect that.

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:36.720
It kind of caught me by surprise.

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:38.010
But it's all right.

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:39.750
I mean, you got the best of me.

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:41.280
I mean, it's embarrassing.

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:44.250
I mean, I'm a sports
analyst losing sports bet

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:47.400
to a premier singer and talk show host.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:50.460
But you know, I mean, these
kind of things happen.

00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:51.660
I just have to deal with it.

00:02:51.660 --> 00:02:52.650
I have to take it.

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:53.483
- Oh my God.

00:02:53.483 --> 00:02:54.750
I gotta be honest with you.

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:57.600
No one, and I know saw
that coming, but I will

00:02:57.600 --> 00:03:00.150
tell you, my favorite part
of the entire Super Bowl

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:02.640
even topping, 'cause I
loved Rihanna and Stapleton,

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:03.810
everybody, Babyface, everybody.

00:03:03.810 --> 00:03:05.400
Shirley, everybody did such a great job.

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:06.960
The players, everybody.

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:09.990
But my favorite part of the Super Bowl

00:03:09.990 --> 00:03:11.840
was turning around and looking at you

00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:15.437
right before the Chiefs won.

00:03:15.437 --> 00:03:16.838
(Kelly laughing)

00:03:16.838 --> 00:03:18.900
- I mean, it was, it felt so good.

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:20.760
And I just couldn't
stop laughing about it.

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:22.140
I was like, "I don't know
how this is happening,

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:23.460
but I'm so happy."

00:03:23.460 --> 00:03:25.770
And is there anything
else that you want to say

00:03:25.770 --> 00:03:28.378
before you announce
your new favorite team?

00:03:28.378 --> 00:03:30.030
(Kelly laughing)

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:32.546
- I'm not announcing a new favorite team.

00:03:32.546 --> 00:03:35.847
That is not the bet we had.
That is not the bet we had.

00:03:35.847 --> 00:03:39.030
The Dallas Cowboy, no,
I'm not doing it, Kelly.

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:40.275
I don't remember it this way.

00:03:40.275 --> 00:03:41.108
- [Stephen] But I will say this.

00:03:41.108 --> 00:03:42.297
I don't remember it this way.

00:03:42.297 --> 00:03:43.471
- [Stephen] I will say this.

00:03:43.471 --> 00:03:44.304
I...

00:03:45.510 --> 00:03:46.950
- Get it out.

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:49.170
- Hold on, hold on.

00:03:49.170 --> 00:03:50.880
I...

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:52.083
I love The Cowboys!

00:03:52.975 --> 00:03:54.097
- Oh my God!
(audience cheering)

00:03:54.097 --> 00:03:55.537
- I've said it, okay?!

00:03:55.537 --> 00:03:56.382
- You heard it here.

00:03:56.382 --> 00:03:58.631
- [Stephen] I've said it, all right.

00:03:58.631 --> 00:04:00.297
(Kelly and Stephen laughing)

00:04:00.297 --> 00:04:01.873
- Oh my God!
Oh my God!

00:04:01.873 --> 00:04:03.690
I love you so much!

00:04:03.690 --> 00:04:06.180
Hey, you, you owned it
and you, you did it.

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:07.560
You followed through with the bet.

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:08.580
That's a man of your word.

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:09.413
I'm just saying.

00:04:09.413 --> 00:04:11.998
Cowboys lover, Stephen
A. Smith, everybody.

00:04:11.998 --> 00:04:13.226
(Kelly laughing and applauding)

00:04:13.226 --> 00:04:14.074
(audience applauding)

00:04:14.074 --> 00:04:15.990
Oh my God, I love it so much.

00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:17.640
I'm liking your post right now

00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:19.623
because it's the greatest bet ever.

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:21.870
Okay, everybody.

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:24.325
Stephen's book is called Straight Shooter.

00:04:24.325 --> 00:04:25.500
- This is torture.
It's out now.

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:27.780
You can also see him mornings on ESPN

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:30.300
as the host of First Take
and listen to his podcast,

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:31.830
No Mercy, wherever you get your podcast.

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:32.663
I love him.

00:04:32.663 --> 00:04:34.500
Y'all got to check him out
if you don't know him already

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:35.790
which you probably do.

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:37.890
But now's the time when
we usually give our guest

00:04:37.890 --> 00:04:39.960
a thousand dollars
courtesy of our season long

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:41.640
partner, Pilot Pen, makers of FriXion,

00:04:41.640 --> 00:04:44.160
the go-to erasable pen of
the Kelly Clarkson Show.

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:46.380
But, Stephen's doing
all right for himself,

00:04:46.380 --> 00:04:48.314
you know, except for losing the bet.

00:04:48.314 --> 00:04:49.410
(Kelly and audience chuckling)

00:04:49.410 --> 00:04:51.254
He said it on my show.

00:04:51.254 --> 00:04:52.830
(Kelly laughing)

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:53.850
Okay.

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:56.790
So today it's going to
someone in the audience.

00:04:56.790 --> 00:04:59.160
The check is taped beneath
someone chair so start

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:00.943
looking for a thousand dollars.

00:05:00.943 --> 00:05:01.776
- Come on.

00:05:01.776 --> 00:05:04.109
(drum roll)

00:05:05.773 --> 00:05:08.105
- (singsongy) Who's got it?

00:05:08.105 --> 00:05:08.938
Yeah?

00:05:08.938 --> 00:05:10.182
(audience cheering)

00:05:10.182 --> 00:05:11.822
(upbeat music playing)

00:05:11.822 --> 00:05:14.739
(Kelly applauding)

00:05:15.937 --> 00:05:17.220
Oh my gosh.

00:05:17.220 --> 00:05:19.932
You literally just went, "Whaat."

00:05:19.932 --> 00:05:23.232
- I was like, "What is it
supposed to feel like?"

00:05:23.232 --> 00:05:24.360
And I'm, "Like this?"

00:05:24.360 --> 00:05:25.800
- [Kelly] Oh my God.
What's your name?

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:27.930
- I'm Alex Lee.

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:29.110
Hi Kelly Clarkson.

00:05:29.110 --> 00:05:30.630
- What?
Hi.

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:32.010
I love your response.

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:32.970
It was amazing.

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:35.130
What do you think you'll
spend the money on?

00:05:35.130 --> 00:05:37.986
- Bad decisions, I don't know.
(audience cheering)

00:05:37.986 --> 00:05:38.819
- Enjoy!

00:05:38.819 --> 00:05:40.594
- [Alex] Thank you.

00:05:40.594 --> 00:05:42.300
- Thank you to all our guests this hour.

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:45.616
Evangeline Lilly, Jonathan
Davis, Dr. Terrence Ferguson,

00:05:45.616 --> 00:05:50.160
Dr. Vernard Hodges, Kelly
Gray, and of course my Cowboys.

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:52.584
Loving man, Stephen A. Smith.

00:05:52.584 --> 00:05:53.550
Have a great day off.

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:55.173
If it's not, try and change it.

